    "body": "Just to note, both [WebGL](https://www.w3.org/TR/webgpu/) and [WebGPU](https://www.w3.org/TR/webgpu/) seem to refer mostly to \"channels\" for bitmaps. [MDN](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Alpha) also seems to prefer this over \"component\". \r\nShould the canvas team be involved since this mostly touches the .canvas.html part?",
